{"sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","items":[{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k001","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"점전하 사이 Coulomb 힘의 크기는 k|q₁q₂|/r²이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k002","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"전기장 E=F/q, 전위차 ΔV=−∫E·dl, 퍼텐셜 에너지 변화 ΔU=qΔV이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k003","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"평행판 축전기 C=εA/d, 에너지 U=CV²/2=Q²/(2C)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k004","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"병렬 축전기는 C의 합, 직렬은 역수의 합이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k005","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"저항 R=ρL/A, Ohm 법칙 V=IR, 전력 P=IV=I²R=V²/R이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k006","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"직렬 저항은 합, 병렬 저항은 역수의 합이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k007","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"Kirchhoff 접점법칙은 전하 보존, 고리법칙은 회로 전위 변화 관계를 반영한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k008","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"RC 충전은 Q(t)=CV(1−e^(−t/RC)), 방전은 Q₀e^(−t/RC)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k009","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"자기장 내 전하에 작용하는 힘은 qv×B이고 자기력 자체는 입자의 운동에너지를 바꾸지 않는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k010","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"Faraday 법칙 ε=−dΦB/dt에서 음의 부호는 Lenz 법칙에 대응한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k011","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"변압기 이상 근사에서 V₂/V₁=N₂/N₁이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k012","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"전기장 단위 N/C=V/m.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"physics-electro--electric-k013","sectionId":"physics-electro/electric","unitId":"physics-electro","subject":"physics","text":"전위는 스칼라, 전기장은 벡터.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","refe